<title>GERMANY: Gehe 1996 pre-tax profits up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Gehe 1996 pre-tax profits up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>Group pre-tax profit from operating activities</p>
<p>						     407     up 15.6 pct</p>
<p>    Net profit				   440     up 108 pct</p>
<p>    Sales					  21,400  vs 19,200</p>
<p>NOTE - German pharmaceuticals wholsesaler Gehe said a significant part of the large increase in net profits was due to acquisitions. It said it was expecting 1997 sales to be boosted by some 1.7 billion marks as a result of the recent acquisition of Lloyds Chemists Plc, with that business also making a positive contribution to profits.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
